# Release packaging does NOT run vsce in this directory: scripts/
# build-production.js bundles the entrypoints (scripts/bundle.mjs) and
# packages from a clean staging dir holding exactly the unbundleable runtime
# externals (see docs/decisions/native-dep-packaging.md). This file only
# guards an ad-hoc `vsce package` run here from shipping the dev tree.
